  $Sigma_1^"(fn)"$. (_Указание._ Пусть
  $
    cal(A) = {f | (exists x) T'_(1, 0) (z_1, f, x)}, quad
    cal(B) = {f | (exists x) T'_(1, 0) (z_2, f, x)}.
  $
  Положим
  $
    cal(A)_1 & = {f | (exists x)[T'_(1, 0) (z_1, f, x) \& (forall y < x) not
                   T'_(1, 0) (z_2, f, y)]}, \
    cal(B)_1 & = {f | (exists y)[T'_(1, 0) (z_2, f, y) \& (forall x <= y) not
                   T'_(1, 0) (z_1, f, x)]}.)
